{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "youtube-downloader-api-collection",
    "name": "YouTube Downloader API",
    "description": "Coleção completa da API REST do YouTube Downloader\n\n## Sobre a API\nEsta API permite:\n- Download de vídeos do YouTube\n- Obtenção de informações de vídeos\n- Monitoramento de progresso de downloads\n- Histórico de downloads com paginação\n\n## Configuração\n1. Configure a variável de ambiente `base_url` (padrão: http://localhost:5000)\n2. Execute o endpoint Health Check para verificar se a API está funcionando\n3. Use os demais endpoints conforme necessário\n\n## Variáveis\n- `base_url`: URL base da API\n- `download_id`: ID do download (preenchido automaticamente)\n- `api_prefix`: Prefixo da API (/api/v1)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "youtube-downloader-api"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has success status', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('API version is present', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.have.property('api_version');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Components status check', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.have.property('components');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.components).to.be.an('object');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{api_prefix}}",
